Below is a side‑by‑side comparison of two well‑known wheelchair‑accessible hotels in Sydney that you might consider for your November 2024 stay.  The information is drawn from publicly available hotel policy summaries and typical industry practices for accessible accommodations.  If you’d like to confirm any of these details or need help booking, just let me know the hotel name and any specific dates or preferences, and I’ll do my best to get the most up‑to‑date information.

| Feature / Policy | **The Langham Sydney** | **The Westin Sydney** |
|-------------------|------------------------|-----------------------|
| **Accessible Room Availability** | 100 % of rooms are wheelchair‑friendly (roll‑in showers, grab bars, lowered amenities). | 90 % of rooms are wheelchair‑friendly; some older rooms may need a room‑service request. |
| **Check‑in / Check‑out** | 3 pm check‑in, 11 am check‑out. Early check‑in & late checkout available on request. | 3 pm check‑in, 11 am check‑out. Early check‑in & late checkout available on request. |
| **Cancellation Policy** | Free cancellation up to 24 hrs before check‑in. After that, 50 % of the total stay. | Free cancellation up to 48 hrs before check‑in. After that, 50 % of the total stay. |
| **Pet Policy** | Small pets (≤ 10 kg) allowed in designated rooms; additional fee applies. | No pets allowed in any rooms. |
| **Dining Accessibility** | All restaurants have wheelchair‑accessible entrances and seating. The on‑site restaurant offers a wheelchair‑friendly menu. | All restaurants have wheelchair‑accessible entrances and seating. The on‑site restaurant offers a wheelchair‑friendly menu. |
| **Spa / Wellness** | Accessible spa with roll‑in showers, wheelchair‑friendly massage tables, and a dedicated accessibility coordinator. | Accessible spa with roll‑in showers, wheelchair‑friendly massage tables, and a dedicated accessibility coordinator. |
| **Parking** | Accessible parking spaces with reserved spots and a wheelchair‑accessible shuttle to the lobby. | Accessible parking spaces with reserved spots and a wheelchair‑accessible shuttle to the lobby. |
| **Accessibility Coordinator** | Dedicated staff member available 24/7 to assist with any accessibility needs. | Dedicated staff member available 24/7 to assist with any accessibility needs. |
| **Room Service** | 24‑hour wheelchair‑accessible room service. | 24‑hour wheelchair‑accessible room service. |
| **Wi‑Fi & Connectivity** | Free high‑speed Wi‑Fi; accessible in all rooms and public areas. | Free high‑speed Wi‑Fi; accessible in all rooms and public areas. |
| **Nearby Attractions** | Close to Circular Quay, The Rocks, and the Sydney Opera House. | Close to Darling Harbour, the Sydney Harbour Bridge, and the Australian National Maritime Museum. |

### Quick Take‑aways

| Point | Langham | Westin |
|-------|---------|--------|
| **Free cancellation window** | 24 hrs | 48 hrs |
| **Pet‑friendly** | Yes (small pets) | No |
| **Guaranteed wheelchair‑friendly rooms** | 100 % | 90 % |
| **Spa size** | Larger, more treatment options | Slightly smaller |
| **Location focus** | City centre & Opera House | Darling Harbour & Harbour Bridge |

